====== GL.iNet GL-MT6000 ======
The GL-MT6000 (Flint 2) is a router based on the MediaTek Filogic 830 SoC that has dual-band 4x4 WiFi 6, two 2.5Gbit WAN, four 1Gbit LAN, 1GB DDR4 RAM, 8GB eMMC storage, and USB 3.2.\\
{{:media:gl.inet:gl-mt6000_1.jpg?300|GL-MT6000 front}} {{:media:gl.inet:gl-mt6000_3.jpg?300|GL-MT6000 back}}

