===== Notes =====
  - Power cable: a relatively short 3ft (1m) cable is included. Users may want to purchase an [[https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJXJG48/|extension cable]].
  - Power switch: users may want to add an [[https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZJ5CKXG/|on/off switch]] which also extends the length of the cable slightly.
  - USB port: located on the side. Users wanting to hide the cable to an external drive may use a [[https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0BZ4LC8QP|USB 3.0 angled adapter]].

